    title="Arithmetic"
    summary="work out sums"
    doc="A general world, not a tab (kids plan, ADR-011; Q18 K4): sums over numbers said with the catalog's words of arithmetic (w.lang.en shard arithmetic: \"what is 3 plus 4\", \"what is double 6\", \"share 12 between 3\"). Its patterns and lexicons are the catalog's frames, generated by scripts/build-calc-world.mjs; each word names the core.calc builtin it means and the operations run the library's builtins. Word problems (who has how many) are calc.story's. Hand-built platform fixture, not produced by the C1 workflow."
